  - m_Id: 4030776615014400
    m_Localized: "TicTacWord is a fast-paced word game where wit and vocabulary matter.\n\nYou
      get word fragments (e.g. \u201C-ing\u201D) and placement rules (e.g. not at
      the end).\n\nYour task is to create a word that:\n\ncontains the given fragment\nand
      follows the placement rule\n\nExample:\n\u201Csingle\u201D \u2714 \n\u201Crunning\u201D
      \u2718 \n\nAfter a correct answer, pass the phone to the next player!\n\nBe
      quick \u2014 don\u2019t let the bomb explode in your hands!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
